<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>How to Read Shoe Style Codes — ResellingShoes.com</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A visual reference for shoe style codes and tags across 70+ brands. Use this to identify the model number when reselling shoes on eBay.">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://resellingshoes.com/style-code-guide">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;0,9..40,700;0,9..40,800;1,9..40,400&family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --ink: #1A1A1A; --ink-2: #3A3630; --ink-3: #6b6b6b; --ink-4: #A39D97;
      --cream: #faf8f5; --cream-dark: #f0ece4; --border: #e5e0d8;
      --walnut: #C4943A; --green: #2F8B5C; --green-hover: #267049;
      --serif: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
      --sans: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    }
    body { font-family: var(--sans); background: var(--cream); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
    a { text-decoration: none; }

    nav {
      background: rgba(250,248,245,0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0 24px; height: 64px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    }
    .nav-logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 18px; color: var(--ink); }
    .nav-logo span { color: var(--green); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 28px; align-items: center; }
    .nav-links a { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-3); }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
    .nav-cta { background: var(--green); color: #fff !important; padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700 !important; }
    .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--green-hover) !important; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta) { display: none; } }

    .page-wrap { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 24px 96px; }

    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--walnut); margin-bottom: 16px; display: block;
    }
    h1 {
      font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
      line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--ink);
    }
    .page-sub { font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink-3); margin-bottom: 48px; max-width: 56ch; line-height: 1.7; }

    .brand-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    @media (min-width: 640px) {
      .brand-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }

    .brand-card {
      background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .brand-card-header {
      padding: 16px 20px 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .brand-name {
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink);
    }
    .brand-images {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }
    .brand-images::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .brand-images img {
      height: 160px;
      width: auto;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }
    .brand-card.single-image .brand-images img {
      height: 180px;
      width: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
      background: var(--cream-dark);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a href="/" class="nav-logo">Reselling<span>Shoes</span>.com</a>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="/learn">Learn</a>
    <a href="/the-everyday-shoe-flip">The Playbook</a>
    <a href="/1000-shoe-reselling-method" class="nav-cta">Free Guide</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="page-wrap">
  <span class="eyebrow">Reference</span>
  <h1>How to Read Shoe Style Codes</h1>
  <p class="page-sub">A visual reference for style tags across {brands.length} brands. Use this to identify the model number when listing shoes on eBay.</p>

  <div class="brand-grid">
    {brands.map((brand) => (
      <div class={`brand-card${brand.images.length === 1 ? ' single-image' : ''}`}>
        <div class="brand-card-header">
          <div class="brand-name">{brand.name}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-images">
          {brand.images.map((img) => (
            <img
              src={`/style-tags/${img}`}
              alt={`${brand.name} style tag`}
              loading="lazy"
            />
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
</div>

<div id="footer-root"></div>
<script is:inline src="/js/footer.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
